"22\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\">WEEK 4 — DESIRE AND CHARACTER</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"805\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\">Want inventory • discomfort dose • dark audit • secret good act</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"840\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#888\">Target: one want retired; character ratio computed</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"900\" width=\"800\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"950\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">DAY 30 — REVIEW AND RE-COMMIT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"990\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Read all thirty entries • score the month • repeat deeper, not wider</text></svg>",
