     "content": "Step back and see the whole machine you now own. Each component came from one lesson; together they form a closed loop that runs on roughly **ten minutes of structure per day** — and converts ordinary days into training data. Nothing in the loop requires good luck, free time, or anyone's cooperation. That was the design requirement all along: a practice made entirely of things that are up to you.",
