      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Six Lessons, One Motion</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A hard event through the assembled system</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"455\" height=\"130\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"307\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1. SORT</text><text x=\"307\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">verdicts not mine; actions mine</text><rect x=\"565\" y=\"170\" width=\"455\" height=\"130\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"792\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2. PERCEPTION</text><text x=\"792\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">bare facts; best-evidenced reading</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"330\" width=\"455\" height=\"130\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"307\" y=\"378\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3. ROLE</text><text x=\"307\" y=\"412\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">recast part, same performance standard</text><rect x=\"565\" y=\"330\" width=\"455\" height=\"130\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"792\" y=\"378\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4. PEOPLE</text><text x=\"792\" y=\"412\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">insults unsigned; carryable handles</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"490\" width=\"455\" height=\"130\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"307\" y=\"538\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5. DESIRE</text><text x=\"307\" y=\"572\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">the parked want found; dish released</text><rect x=\"565\" y=\"490\" width=\"455\" height=\"130\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"792\" y=\"538\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6. CHARACTER</text><text x=\"792\" y=\"572\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">choices vs principles — the scoreboard</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"680\" width=\"700\" height=\"150\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"735\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">THE DAILY SYSTEM</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"780\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Thirty mornings pre-loaded the chain;</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"810\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">thirty evenings tuned it</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"880\" width=\"800\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"935\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Not six techniques —</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"975\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">one trained character, kit assembled</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The art of living: the whole kit, available at speed, on any event."
