     "explanation": "The full chain: Lesson 2's pause precedes any assent; Lesson 4's decision tree splits the criticism — the true part is free coaching (taken), the false part is the critic's error (left unsigned); Lesson 3 keeps the response in role — professional, honest, calm, which may well include a factual clarification made without heat; Lesson 6 keeps the scoreboard internal. The second option fails on ordering and motive: it makes reputation-repair the driver. Total acceptance abandons the truth-test, and total disengagement can abandon the role — sometimes your part genuinely requires a reply.",
